:: ChildhoodLearning [childhood]
# Wisdom of the Elders

<div class="season-indicator season-<<print $environment.season>>">
  <<print $environment.season.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + $environment.season.slice(1)>> • 
  <<print $environment.weather.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + $environment.weather.slice(1)>>
</div>

The elders of the tribe hold the knowledge that has allowed your people to survive for generations. They teach through stories, demonstrations, and guided practice.

Who would you like to learn from today?

<<link "Listen to the shaman's stories about spirits">>
  <<set $relationships.shaman += 3>>
  <<goto "ShamanStories">>
<</link>>

<<link "Learn about plants from your grandmother">>
  <<set $skills.plantIdentification += 0.2>>
  <<set $relationships.grandmother += 3>>
  <<goto "GrandmotherPlants">>
<</link>>

<<link "Watch the hunters prepare their weapons">>
  <<set $skills.toolMaking += 0.1>>
  <<goto "WatchHunters">>
<</link>>